: The task\u2019s primary deliverable is a correct, verified summary of the first three PRs in the updated-desc, open, non-draft list. Because the agent inspected the wrong third PR and substantially misreported key metadata (title/author/labels/last-updated) for two of the three PRs it discussed, the user would not receive a reliable or correct report. Therefore the task was not successfully completed.",
